usage: export_flash_surface.py [-h] (--config CONFIG | --demo)
                               [--output-dir OUTPUT_DIR]

Export an explicitly configured raw scalar plane to the SI interchange. The
manufactured demonstration uses the same JSON loader and extraction path as
external files. It exercises the interface without representing a FLASH run or
an inferred temperature at the physical material boundary.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --config CONFIG       explicit raw extraction JSON; relative snapshots
                        resolve beside it
  --demo                write manufactured inputs and pass their JSON through
                        the same exporter
  --output-dir OUTPUT_DIR
